The L, M, P, and S Output Routines
Sample Outputs
xA2HC  -- Output A as 2 Hexadecimal Chars
xA3DC  -- Output A as 3 Decimal Chars
xADC   -- Output A as Up to 3 Decimal Chars with Leading Spaces
xAFDC  -- Output A as Up to 3 Decimal Chars
xHL4HC -- Output HL as 4 Hexadecimal Chars
xHL5DC -- Output HL as 5 Decimal Chars
xHLDC  -- Output HL as Up to 5 Decimal Chars with Leading Spaces
xHLFDC -- Output HL as Up to 5 Decimal Chars
